# ── API — multer DoS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Attack requires multipart/form-data POST requests. This API has no file upload
# or multipart routes — all endpoints use JSON body. The only npm-suggested fix
# is downgrading to NestJS 7.5.5, which would be a full framework major downgrade.
# Review: when @nestjs/platform-express ships a multer update compatible with NestJS 11.
GHSA-72gw-mp4g-v24j	api	2026-06-19	multer DoS via nested fields; no multipart routes; fix incompatible with NestJS 11
GHSA-3p4h-7m6x-2hcm	api	2026-06-19	multer DoS via aborted upload cleanup; no multipart routes; fix incompatible with NestJS 11

# ── Mobile — @xmldom/xmldom XML injection ─────────────────────────────────────
# @xmldom/xmldom is used by @expo/config-plugins for iOS .plist / xcode XML
# processing during Expo build-time config. It is NOT bundled into the mobile
# app runtime. The attack would require a malicious Expo plugin executing during
# the native build — not a production runtime risk.
# Review: when expo@56+ is safe to adopt (full regression test required).
